{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日過ぎちゃいましたが\nみさみさお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/06/5196966/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は\nブログに書くことが本当に無いんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日は都内のおばあちゃん家\n3～5日は友達とご飯\nって感じですね\\( ･ω･)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯って言っても\n遊んでるだけじゃない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと生まれるものもある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで\n毎年フワッと生きてた中田だけど\n今年は友達と抱負を決めようってなったので\nここに掲げます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/06/5196966/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細かく言うと\nサンエトでまた何かやる！とか\nバースデーライブやりたい！とか\nアンダー全国ツアー成功！とか\nいろいろあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと\n目標をもって生きるべきだなーって思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細かい目標を\n逐一モバメとかで書こうかなーって思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/01/06/5196966/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}